  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Greenhouse is a structured-hiring ATS/CRM from sourcing through offer and onboarding, with interview kits, scorecards, scheduling, and recruiting analytics. Named plans are Core, Plus, and Pro. Cost is custom-quote — influenced by plan, hiring volume, organizational complexity, and features. No free plan or self-serve trial (demo). AI features (notetaker, suggestions, Voice AI, Real Talent) are marketed and often tier-gated.",
    "bestFor": [
      "Mid-market and enterprise teams that want structured hiring (kits, scorecards, governance)",
      "Talent orgs comparing Greenhouse as the default dedicated ATS",
